#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid ""
"<b>Tracking is on but nobody is being asked for consent.</b>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Google and Meta would start measuring on the first page view,\n"
"                        which a site aimed at the EU may not do. Switch\n"
"                        <b>Ask visitors for consent</b> on above."
msgstr "<b>Měření běží, ale nikdo se neptá na souhlas.</b>                        <br/>                        Google a Meta by začaly měřit hned při první návštěvě, což web mířený do EU nesmí. Zapněte výš <b>Ptát se návštěvníků na souhlas</b>."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid "Ask visitors for consent before any tracking runs."
msgstr "Ptát se návštěvníků na souhlas, než se cokoliv začne měřit."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model,name:gelato_tracking.model_res_config_settings
msgid "Config Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid "Conversion tracking"
msgstr "Měření konverzí"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:gelato_tracking.field_res_config_settings__cookies_bar
msgid "Cookies Bar"
msgstr "Cookie lišta"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gelato_tracking.field_res_config_settings__cookies_bar
msgid "Display a customizable cookies bar on your website."
msgstr "Zobrazit na webu cookie lištu, kterou si můžete upravit."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid "GTM-XXXXXXX"
msgstr "GTM-XXXXXXX"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid "Google Tag Manager"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:gelato_tracking.field_res_config_settings__gelato_gtm_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:gelato_tracking.field_website__gelato_gtm_id
msgid "Google Tag Manager ID"
msgstr "ID Google Tag Manageru"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid ""
"Google and Meta are held back until the visitor accepts optional\n"
"                        cookies. Until then their scripts do not load and set nothing."
msgstr "Google a Meta se drží zpátky, dokud návštěvník nepřijme volitelné cookies. Do té doby se jejich skripty vůbec nenačtou a nic si neuloží."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gelato_tracking.field_res_config_settings__gelato_gtm_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gelato_tracking.field_website__gelato_gtm_id
msgid ""
"In the form GTM-XXXXXXX. An empty field switches tracking off entirely - no "
"script is added to the page."
msgstr "Ve tvaru GTM-XXXXXXX. Prázdné pole měření úplně vypne – do stránky se nevloží žádný skript."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid "Meta Pixel"
msgstr "Meta Pixel"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:gelato_tracking.field_res_config_settings__gelato_meta_pixel_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:gelato_tracking.field_website__gelato_meta_pixel_id
msgid "Meta Pixel ID"
msgstr "ID Meta Pixelu"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid ""
"The container ID, in the form GTM-XXXXXXX. Leave the field empty and no "
"tracking script is added to the website."
msgstr "ID kontejneru ve tvaru GTM-XXXXXXX. Když pole necháte prázdné, do webu se nevloží žádný měřicí skript."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid ""
"The pixel number from the Events Manager. Leave the field empty and the "
"pixel is not added to the website."
msgstr "Číslo pixelu ze Správce událostí. Když pole necháte prázdné, pixel se do webu nevloží."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gelato_tracking.field_res_config_settings__gelato_meta_pixel_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gelato_tracking.field_website__gelato_meta_pixel_id
msgid ""
"The pixel number from the Facebook Events Manager. An empty field switches "
"tracking off entirely."
msgstr "Číslo pixelu ze Správce událostí na Facebooku. Prázdné pole měření úplně vypne."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid "Visitors are asked before anything is measured."
msgstr "Návštěvníci se napřed zeptáme, než se cokoliv začne měřit."

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model:ir.model,name:gelato_tracking.model_website
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Web"

#. module: gelato_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gelato_tracking.res_config_settings_view_form_gelato_tracking
msgid ""
"When a delivery order is completed, a <b>purchase</b> event is sent to\n"
"                        both tools with the order number, the total, the discount, the delivery\n"
"                        fee and the line items."
msgstr "Když někdo dokončí objednávku rozvozu, odešle se do obou nástrojů událost <b>purchase</b> s číslem objednávky, částkou, slevou, dopravou a položkami."
